--- que es cada serie, segun la ayuda de R (titulo y descripcion) ---
[ENT-04 ?co2] Mauna Loa Atmospheric CO2 Concentration
[ENT-04 ?co2] Description:
[ENT-04 ?co2]      Atmospheric concentrations of CO2 are expressed in parts per
[ENT-04 ?co2]      million (ppm) and reported in the preliminary 1997 SIO manometric
[ENT-04 ?co2]      mole fraction scale.
[ENT-04 ?nottem] Average Monthly Temperatures at Nottingham, 1920-1939
[ENT-04 ?nottem] Description:
[ENT-04 ?nottem]      A time series object containing average air temperatures at
[ENT-04 ?nottem]      Nottingham Castle in degrees Fahrenheit for 20 years.
[ENT-04 ?USAccDeaths] Accidental Deaths in the US 1973-1978
[ENT-04 ?USAccDeaths] Description:
[ENT-04 ?USAccDeaths]      A time series giving the monthly totals of accidental deaths in
[ENT-04 ?USAccDeaths]      the USA.  The values for the first six months of 1979 are 7798
[ENT-04 ?USAccDeaths]      7406 8363 8460 9217 9316.
[ENT-04 ?AirPassengers] Monthly Airline Passenger Numbers 1949-1960
[ENT-04 ?AirPassengers] Description:
[ENT-04 ?AirPassengers]      The classic Box & Jenkins airline data.  Monthly totals of
[ENT-04 ?AirPassengers]      international airline passengers, 1949 to 1960.
[ENT-04 ?UKgas] UK Quarterly Gas Consumption
[ENT-04 ?UKgas] Description:
[ENT-04 ?UKgas]      Quarterly UK gas consumption from 1960Q1 to 1986Q4, in millions of
[ENT-04 ?UKgas]      therms.

